    kind: work_item  # dc33
    title: "A docstring taken from a comment block uses the block's first line as the summary even when that line is decoration or a shebang: sketch prints a row of dashes or \"!/bin/bash\" as what a function does"  # dc33
    status: todo_hard  # dc33
    priority: 4  # dc33
